Not too difficult for a lvl60 warrior to do this phase w/o aggroing much, but you may have to die a couple times.&nbsp; First kill the 2 guards just inside instance entrance, then wind your way thru the main hall to the opening of the prison corridor.&nbsp; You'll want to watch the pattern of the guard/hound pats for a bit first maybe -so that you can time your route.&nbsp; 
Then climb up the right-hand-side of the prison tunnel entrance; you can sneak past the guards and hounds there without aggroing them if you go high enough on that wall.
Kharan's cell is the first on the left.&nbsp; Watch out for pats, then charge the hound outside Kharan's cell.&nbsp; Fear everybody away, then switch to D stance and shield wall.&nbsp; Then open door with either the key or a lg seaforium charge (engr). This may be all u have time for before guards return and that's ok b/c door will stay open.&nbsp; 
Try to kill the hound before you die if you want to sneak back in with inviso. 
Make sure you have auto-complete on for npc speaches for next part.&nbsp; If you rez n come back with inviso potion or engr trinket then u have all the time in the world to talk with Kharan - he's outside of aggro area of remaining guards posted at his door.&nbsp; I prefer this, b/c then u can just hearth out.&nbsp; gl!

