The Fury Vison is good for lelvel 50 but easily replaced by Lionheart and is not good at all for protection warriors due to lack of stamina.&nbsp; 

The Razorsteel Shoulders are fairly well rounded and the +1% to hit is certainly nice, but by the time you've been 60 for a while they will be eventually replaced.&nbsp; 

The trinket however, is nearly irreplacable.&nbsp; The only upgrade is the Earthstike epic trinket which requires Exalted rep with the Cenarion Circle, but even the Earthstike only lasts 20 seconds.&nbsp; For fury warriors you want all the AP you can get.&nbsp; Yes, get crusader (that's 100 strength = 200 AP).&nbsp; I am fury, with Deathbringer and Core Hound Tooth, both with crusader. That's 400 AP when they both proc at the same time, which is fairly often.&nbsp; Plus the 150 AP from this trinket [b]for a minute[/b]?&nbsp; No question, if you are thinking long term, go for the trinket.

